{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Golden values for the shader standard library (public/shaders/_std). Run on SwiftShader by scripts/shaderlib-golden.ts (npm run shaderlib:golden). `analytic` cases are hand-derived and never rewritten; the rest pin the implementation and are captured with --update. src/shaderlib/stdlib.test.ts cross-checks every pcg case against an exact TypeScript reference, so the GPU capture cannot silently bless a wrong hash.",
